  "ruleText": "He-P 4047.02 Scope. The provisions of He-P 4047 are in addition to, and are not substitutions for, other applicable provisions of this chapter.\n\nSource. #6827, eff 8-6-98; ss by #8692, INTERIM, eff 7-27-06, EXPIRES: 2-2-07; ss by #8808, eff 1-24-07; ss by #10764, INTERIM, eff 1-23-15, EXPIRES: 7-22-15; ss by #10894, eff 7-21-15\n\nNew. #14598, INTERIM, eff 5-22-26, EXPIRES: 11-18-26",
